  Q: 6855/32768 fp32 values differ bit for bit (3251 inside dims<n_rot, 3604 pass-through), max|err|=1.192e-06 at 25376
  K: 1224/262144 fp32 values differ (702 rotated, 522 pass-through), max|err|=7.153e-07 at 3104
